      "constraints": [
        "Keep control local and owner-session scoped; never bypass TCC, permissions or explicit sensitive action authority.",
        "Bind control to exact application, PID, launch instance and window identity; dispatch success does not prove the intended visible result.",
        "Preserve expiring digest-bound single-use task authority and daemon lifecycle drain interlocks; unavailable and unhealthy states remain explicit blockers.",
        "Require independent focus/window observations for layout success; capability readiness and browser orchestrator declarations do not grant execution or verified outcome authority.",
        "Preserve redaction and installed runtime parity evidence separately from source tests; current installed daemon mismatch and legacy release-evidence dependency remain explicit gaps.",
        "Keep four unregistered child contract drafts unratified; root source association does not enroll children, install skills, register LaunchAgents or update the runtime."
